    "notes": [
      {
        "version": "0.1.0",
        "releaseChannel": "STABLE",
        "title": "SDKWork Doctor 0.1.0",
        "summary": "Family private-doctor agent app: patient files, the sdkwork-agents family doctor, conversation 病历 with an AI draft diagnosis the doctor confirms, a real human-doctor directory with in-conversation human consultations, and device-local visit records on four clients.",
        "content": "SDKWork Doctor is a family private-doctor agent application. A household keeps one patient file per member (allergies, chronic conditions, medications, notes) and switches the active patient for the conversation. Exactly four tabs ship on every client: 对话 (the sdkwork-agents family doctor with deterministic emergency-first triage, file/image/video attachments, a patient-operated end-conversation action, and a conversation list that badges unread doctor replies), 医生 (a directory of real human doctors with family-doctor selection; 发起人工问诊 opens a human consultation in the conversation home), 记录 (every 病历 and visit on this device, and the doctor's own reply surface for a human consultation), and 我的 (patient files, my doctors, visit records, conversation mode, device checks). Ending an AI conversation asks the agent for a 病历 (summary, transcript, attachments, and a tentative AI diagnosis); the attending doctor confirms it, amends it with their own diagnosis, or records a diagnosis independently, and both diagnosis records stay readable. A human consultation is a conversation between the family and the chosen doctor: the reason is the first patient turn, the doctor replies on the same device, and the session row shows the unread reply count until the family opens it. The browser surfaces also keep a workbench landing at the surface root. The human-doctor roster is deployment content bound through runtime-env key careDoctorDirectoryUrl, with an authored fallback roster when no directory is configured; the sdkwork-agents agent catalogue proves the managed family-doctor agent is deployed.",
        "highlights": [
          "Four tabs (对话 / 医生 / 记录 / 我的) on PC, H5, Flutter, and the WeChat mini program",
          "Patient-ended conversations become one 病历 with the transcript, attachments, and the agent summary",
          "Two independent diagnosis records: the AI draft and the doctor's own diagnosis, with an explicit doctor confirmation",
          "File / image / video attachments on a conversation, stored on the device and carried into the 病历",
          "Multiple patient files per household with one active patient for the conversation",
          "Real human-doctor directory with selection, primary doctor, multi-site consultation, and 发起人工问诊 that opens the conversation",
          "Human consultation in the conversation home: the doctor replies on the same device and every session row carries its unread reply count",
          "Doctor employment model: Appbase organization + med_hospital reference per affiliation, full-time / part-time / contract / visiting, multi-site consultation",
          "sdkwork-agents app API integration: session, turn stream, case-record summary turn, and agent catalogue",
          "Device-local visit records, including human consultations with the doctor recorded",
          "One authored copy contract projected into TypeScript, Dart, and mini program catalogs"
        ],
        "packageIds": [
          "pc-web-browser-standalone-web-url",
          "pc-web-browser-cloud-web-url",
          "h5-browser-standalone-web-url",
          "h5-browser-cloud-web-url",
          "mp-weixin-mini-program-standalone-binary",
          "flutter-ios-standalone-binary",
          "flutter-android-standalone-binary"
        ],
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z",
        "current": true,
        "forceUpdate": false,
        "minSupportedVersion": "0.1.0",
        "metadata": {}
      }
    ]
